-    *   $\theta_D$: The angle between $\boldsymbol{\omega}_B$ and the visibility boundary direction at $\mathbf{x}_0^D$.
-    *   $\theta_S$: The angle between $\boldsymbol{\omega}_B$ and the surface normal $\mathbf{n}$ at $\mathbf{x}_0^S$.
